 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Black Bird Manipulation — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>When you reach 3rd level, you are constantly followed by an omen of death, giving you an aura of terror. As a bonus action, you force each creature of your choice that you can see within 30 ft to make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, a creature becomes frightened of you for 1 minute. A frightened creature can repeat the save at the end of its turns, ending the effect on a success.<br />\n You have advantage on attack rolls against frightened creatures.  </p>",
